OL,3,GNEWSAApproval for 850 homes despite
OL,4,Ahundreds of objections
OL,5,
OL,6,FOutline plans for up to 850 new homes
OL,7,Fhave been approved despite concerns
OL,8,Faround road safety, congestion and
OL,9,Fpressure on local services from
OL,10,Fhundreds of people.
OL,12,FThe project at Priors Farm, on the
OL,13,FWokingham/Bracknell border, was
OL,14,Fapproved by Wokingham Borough Council
OL,15,Fat a meeting on Wednesday.
OL,17,FThe 56-hectare (138-acre) site, west of
OL,18,FOld Wokingham Road and either side of
OL,19,FEasthampstead Road, could include 340
OL,20,Faffordable homes, a neighbourhood
OL,21,Fcentre, public open space and land for
OL,22,Fa primary school.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
